                                "sense_id": "95a43650-f3c5-3578-8d19-189da8fd45f6",
                                "text": "He call’d it Hæmony, and gave it me / And bad me keepe it as of ſoveraine uſe / Gainſt all inchantments, mildew blaſt, or damp / Or gaſtly furies apparition; / […]",
